<para id="RM000000CD2055X" category="D" type-id="304CS" name-id="ESJIV-05" from="200912">
<name>Freeze Frame Data/Detailed Diagnostic Information</name>
<subpara id="RM000000CD2055X_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___0000INK00000">
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<step1>
<ptxt>Freeze Frame Data Check (Reading Using TaSCAN)</ptxt>
<step2>
<ptxt>Using the SST (TaSCAN), operate according to the screen display, and select a DTC with recorded freeze frame data (F displayed) from [Diagnosis Function Menu] - [DTC Check Screen].</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Freeze frame data stores the engine condition when 3 DTCs are detected.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Freeze frame data is classified as shown below, and freeze frame data for 1 DTCs is stored for each group.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.77in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="5.31in"/>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry morerows="2" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Group Classification</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry>
<ptxt>DTCs output for misfire detection (P0300, P0301, P0302, P0303, P0304), rich malfunction (P0172) and lean malfunction (P0171)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry>
<ptxt>DTCs that illuminate the check engine light</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry>
<ptxt>DTCs that do not illuminate the check engine light</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<ptxt>For whether the check engine light illuminates, refer to the DTC Chart (<xref label="Seep01" href="X39400000QT041D"/>).</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Time-series freeze frame data allows the engine condition (ECU data) before and after DTC detection to be checked.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Using time-series freeze frame data is helpful for troubleshooting when the symptom cannot be reproduced.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</step2>
</step1>
